VD-uni commands (run ./scripts/vd <command> --help for options)
  download URL [URL ...] [--file urls.txt] [--fragments 8] [--remux mkv]
  convert INPUT -o OUTPUT [--engine auto|ffmpeg|vlc] [--mode auto|copy|transcode]
  probe INPUT
  formats [URL] [--full]
  doctor [--json]
  cookies --browser chrome --domain example.com
  update
  version
  help
GUI: ./scripts/vd-gui (downloads; local conversion is currently CLI-only)
